{"sha":"ca176752fbceec49c6b4777a2c18ae88e4eb10ed","node_id":"C_kwDOPvhOH9oAKGNhMTc2NzUyZmJjZWVjNDljNmI0Nzc3YTJjMThhZTg4ZTRlYjEwZWQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Lingjie Chen","email":"108717053+lingjiechen2@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-04-15T04:53:58Z"},"committer":{"name":"Zhanhui Zhou","email":"zhanhui@berkeley.edu","date":"2026-04-15T04:54:54Z"},"message":"Refactor GRPO pipeline and add RL training examples for LLaDA and A2D (#108)\n\n- Move DiffuGRPOTrainer/Config from dllm/pipelines/llada/ to dllm/pipelines/rl/\n  as a model-agnostic RL pipeline\n- Organize dllm/pipelines/rl/ under grpo/ subpackage to align with examples/rl/grpo/\n  structure: grpo/trainer.py, grpo/datasets.py, grpo/rewards/\n- Add dllm/pipelines/rl/grpo/rewards/ with per-task reward functions (format, math,\n  countdown, sudoku, code), each with verbose=False for silent training by default\n- Add dllm/pipelines/rl/grpo/datasets.py to unify dataset loading and reward mapping\n  across models via get_dataset_and_rewards()\n- Add examples/rl/grpo/llada/train.py and examples/rl/grpo/a2d/mdlm/train.py\n  as thin training scripts sharing the same pipeline\n- Fix BlockMask fallback in A2D models: use an empty class instead of torch.Tensor\n  to prevent isinstance(any_tensor, BlockMask) from always returning True when\n  flex_attention is unavailable (PyTorch < 2.5), which silently skipped the\n  2D->4D attention mask conversion and caused SDPA dtype mismatch errors\n- Remove old examples/llada/grpo.py and dllm/pipelines/llada/grpo.py\n- Add examples/rl/README.md with GRPO training instructions for LLaDA and A2D\n- Add reward curve figures (llada_grpo.png, a2d_grpo.png) to examples/rl/assets/\n- Add RL news entry to README; update GRPO citation to d1/diffu-grpo\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"28bd9bddc7d4a6b505cdbf7209d5558f176ff92b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZHZisZZ/dllm/git/trees/28bd9bddc7d4a6b505cdbf7209d5558f176ff92b"},"url":"https://a